IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Non mi inganni!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Hai tutta l'aria di
qualcuno che ama la notte e il buio{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sei una creatura lunare, vero?!{{TAG:0008:0005:0E0015000F002800}}
Mi hai scoperto!
Certo che no!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Yeter artık, gerçek yüzünü göster!
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} festivalinde böyle
ortalıkta dolaşıyorsun{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aslında aydan gelen bir uzaylısın, değil mi?!{{TAG:0008:0005:0E0015000F002800}}
Eveeeeeeet!
Tabii ki hayır!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Esta noche celebramos
algo llamado {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Luna de Otoño{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
aquí en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Miramos todos la luna y comemos
un montón de comida de primera!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡Y luego corremos hacia la luna!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bueno, esa última parte de correr
hacia la luna es algo que me
gustaría hacer a mí, ¡ja, ja!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}lune d'automne{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} n'est peut-être
pas l'événement le plus prestigieux
de l'année, mais tout de même !
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sans lune, la nuit, on y verrait rien !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
C'est un peu notre lampadaire à
tous,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Penses-y...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu sai già cosa succede stasera,
vero? Certo che sì!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}} festeggiamo la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}luna
d'autunno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} osservando tutta la notte
quel grande disco bianco in cielo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sai, quando la luna è piena,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} di solito
mi alleno particolarmente bene.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
